### Получение истории чата
POST {{host}}/api/chat/get_history_chat?employee_id={{employee_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticket_id": 125,
  "from_post": "fdslkafmpme",
  "count_post": 5
}

